{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_knowledge_cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21", "label": "CME Open Interest Regime Study", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_knowledge_cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21_oi_quadrants", "label": "CME OI Price-OI Quadrant Regimes", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Quadrants = sign of 5-day price change x 5-day OI change on CME daily OI. Hollow rally (price up, OI down) has the weakest forward 21d returns (+1.36% vs +2.99% baseline); direction replicates in fresh 2025. Monthly-horizon exposure-dial candidate, NOT a per-trade filter: the trade-level effect was pure look-ahead (CME OI publishes next morning) and vanishes when lagged causally; the daily sizing dial was also rejected interventionally.", "source_file": "cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_knowledge_cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21_oi_divergence_vindication", "label": "oi_divergence Data-Quality Vindication", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "The oi_divergence archetype was reading garbage (perp snapshot OI), not wrong in premise: swapping to causal CME daily OI flips the CME era 2021-2024 from -$5.3K to +$6.8K (WR 37% -> 59%), confirmed on two independent tests. Status upgraded DEAD(leak) -> instrument with a proven data-quality path; needs a live daily CME OI feed before promotion.", "source_file": "cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_knowledge_cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21", "target": "docs_knowledge_cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21_oi_quadrants", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "cme_oi_regime_study_2026_08_21.md", "source_